","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grievances"},{"text":"Discipline"},{"text":"Investigations"},{"text":"Workplace disputes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Industrial Relations"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unions"},{"text":"Collective bargaining"},{"text":"Manufacturing workforce"},{"text":"Industrial disputes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employment Litigation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Labour disputes"},{"text":"Employment claims"},{"text":"Legal notices"},{"text":"Litigation support"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HR Legal Operations"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy"},{"text":"Contract lifecycle"},{"text":"Compliance systems"},{"text":"Legal operations"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Legal Intern","Legal Assistant","Legal Executive","Senior Legal Executive","Legal Officer / Employment Specialist","Legal Manager","Employment Counsel / Legal Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"HR-Legal Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal Executive","HR Legal Specialist","Employee Relations Legal Lead","HR Compliance Manager","Head of Employee Relations / Compliance"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Employment-Law Issues","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The modern Legal Executive should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted recruitment"},{"text":"Algorithmic hiring"},{"text":"Employee monitoring"},{"text":"Remote work"},{"text":"Gig workers"},{"text":"Platform workers"},{"text":"Digital workplace policies"},{"text":"Employee data protection"},{"text":"AI-generated workplace content"},{"text":"Workplace surveillance"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Cross-border remote employment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI Recruitment Example"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI Screening","Candidate Ranking","Potential Bias / Discrimination Risk","Human Review","Legal & Policy Assessment"]},{"type":"p","text":"Legal professionals will increasingly need to understand how automated HR systems affect employee rights and organizational risk."}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong Legal Executive candidate should have:"},{"type":"h","text":"Legal"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Labour law"},{"text":"Employment law"},{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Company law"},{"text":"Dispute resolution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HR"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee lifecycle"},{"text":"HR policies"},{"text":"Employee relations"},{"text":"Compensation awareness"},{"text":"Workplace investigations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Labour compliance"},{"text":"Workplace safety awareness"},{"text":"Social-security awareness"},{"text":"Employment documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Contract review"},{"text":"Legal drafting"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HRMS awareness"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Legal databases"},{"text":"Document management"},{"text":"AI-assisted legal research"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LL.B."},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Labour & Employment Law"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Contract Law"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Company Law"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Employment Contracts"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"HR Policies"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Labour Compliance"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Employee Relations"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Workplace Investigations"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Disciplinary Procedures"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Grievance Management"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Industrial Relations"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Legal Research"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Legal Drafting"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Employment Dispute Support"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Privacy"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"HRMS Awareness"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Excel & Analytics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI-Assisted Legal Research"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Corporate Internship"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Employment-Law Portfolio"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest graduate profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal Executive","Employment-Law Specialist","HR Legal & Compliance Professional","Contract Reviewer","Workplace Investigation Support Professional","Legal-Tech/AI-Aware Practitioner"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the most valuable combination is employment law + practical HR understanding + contract drafting + compliance + employee-relations skills. A candidate who can review an employment agreement, identify compliance risks, support a workplace investigation, understand employee grievances, research applicable law and communicate clearly with both HR and management will be well positioned for a Legal Executive role."}]}]}